ENRICH {"name": "lobby", "prose": "It was this massive hotel lobby but completely dead, nobody at the desk. Just rows of velvet chairs that looked faded, almost grey under these yellow lights. The air felt heavy, like a basement after it rains. There was this huge grandfather clock in the corner, but the hands weren't moving, just stuck.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a massive, empty hotel lobby", "origin": "derived", "id": "hotel_lobby", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "an unoccupied reception desk", "origin": "derived", "id": "reception_desk"}, {"role": "text", "text": "rows of faded velvet chairs, their color dulled to a muted grey under the yellow lighting", "origin": "derived", "id": "velvet_chairs"}, {"role": "text", "text": "heavy, damp air reminiscent of a basement after rain", "origin": "derived", "id": "atmosphere"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a large grandfather clock in the corner with motionless hands, frozen in place", "origin": "derived", "id": "grandfather_clock"}]}], "compiled": "a massive, empty hotel lobby, an unoccupied reception desk, rows of faded velvet chairs, their color dulled to a muted grey under the yellow lighting, heavy, damp air reminiscent of a basement after rain, a large grandfather clock in the corner with motionless hands, frozen in place.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 304, "out_chars": 284}
ENRICH {"name": "highway", "prose": "An endless stretch of black asphalt cutting through nothing. The sky is that weird bruised purple right before the sun comes up. No cars, no movement, just a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind. It feels lonely, like the edge of the world.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "an endless stretch of black asphalt", "origin": "derived", "id": "asphalt"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a bruised purple sky", "origin": "derived", "id": "sky"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind", "origin": "derived", "id": "billboard"}, {"role": "text", "text": "lonely, like the edge of the world", "origin": "derived", "id": "atmosphere"}], "compiled": "an endless stretch of black asphalt, a bruised purple sky, a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind, lonely, like the edge of the world.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 248, "out_chars": 142}
