ENRICH {"name": "blurred-man", "prose": "I saw a guy standing under a streetlamp across the wet pavement. He had a heavy coat on, collar turned up against the mist. I couldn't see his face at all, just the glow from his cigarette lighting up the smoke around his head. He was just watching the dark windows of the house next to me.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a rainy night street scene", "origin": "derived", "id": "scene", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "a single streetlamp casting a warm glow", "origin": "derived", "id": "streetlamp", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "a man standing under the streetlamp, wearing a heavy coat with the collar turned up", "origin": "derived", "id": "man", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "his face is obscured, only the glow from his cigarette lighting up the smoke around his head", "origin": "derived", "id": "face"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a cigarette glowing in the smoke", "origin": "derived", "id": "cigarette"}]}]}, {"role": "text", "text": "wet pavement reflecting the light", "origin": "derived", "id": "pavement"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a house with dark windows across the street", "origin": "derived", "id": "house"}]}], "compiled": "a rainy night street scene, a single streetlamp casting a warm glow, a man standing under the streetlamp, wearing a heavy coat with the collar turned up, his face is obscured, only the glow from his cigarette lighting up the smoke around his head, a cigarette glowing in the smoke, wet pavement reflecting the light, a house with dark windows across the street.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 290, "out_chars": 361}
