ENRICH {"name": "hand", "prose": "We were walking through a regular forest, but suddenly the trees cleared and there was this colossal stone hand bursting out of the dirt. Just the hand, fingers reaching up like it was trying to grab the clouds. Moss was growing all over the knuckles. It felt ancient and terrifying.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a dense forest", "origin": "derived", "id": "0"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a colossal stone hand", "origin": "derived", "id": "1", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "bursting out of the dirt", "origin": "derived", "id": "2"}, {"role": "text", "text": "fingers reaching up", "origin": "derived", "id": "3", "children": [{"role": "text", "text": "like trying to grab the clouds", "origin": "derived", "id": "4"}]}]}, {"role": "text", "text": "moss growing over the knuckles", "origin": "derived", "id": "5"}, {"role": "text", "text": "ancient and terrifying atmosphere", "origin": "derived", "id": "6"}], "compiled": "a dense forest, a colossal stone hand, bursting out of the dirt, fingers reaching up, like trying to grab the clouds, moss growing over the knuckles, ancient and terrifying atmosphere.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 283, "out_chars": 184}
